OL,3,GNEWSAFood hub sees rise in working
OL,4,Afamilies needing help
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of a food hub in Leicester
OL,7,Fhas said it is increasingly supporting
OL,8,Fworking families on low incomes who are
OL,9,Fstruggling with the cost of living.
OL,11,FKatie Wray, who runs Christ the King
OL,12,FFood Hub in Beaumont Leys, said rising
OL,13,Fcosts meant the organisation was
OL,14,Fincreasingly helping people with debt,
OL,15,Fenergy bills and other financial
OL,16,Fdifficulties alongside food support.
OL,18,FShe said the impact on families was
OL,19,F"phenomenal" and that it was supporting
OL,20,Fpeople with a range of financial
OL,21,Fdifficulties, including transport costs
OL,22,Fand getting children to school.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
